  "details": "Noticed it just today. I was messing trying out some stuff on the beta. After the latest beta was installed, all my settings were reverted back to default settings. I am 99.9% sure that on very first builds I did set all the settings near same that I have on PC. Had some time off from beta and today launched it after some time and joined to lobby. Started watching my settings and saw that my settings were reverted back. This exposed for example my avatar to be cloned which is bad. I tried to reproduce by going back a build but did not work. Will try out again when new build comes out",
